/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
/corpus/data/
/corpus/cache/
# bench/results/raw/ was ignored wholesale. That silently un-published the
# measured evidence for three ACCEPTED ADRs — ADR-2's chunk parameters, ADR-3's
# store backend, and ADR-4's fsync benchmark, which is what establishes that
# fsync(2) is not crash-safe on macOS and therefore underpins ADR-18. A reader
# who cloned the repository could not check any of them. The four files total
# 24 KB and are now committed; genuinely large raw output can be ignored by
# name when it appears.
/harness/.venv/
/prototypes/*/target
.DS_Store
*.profraw
/tmp/
/.lattice/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
harness/lib/iofault/*.dylib
harness/lib/iofault/*.so
harness/lib/iofault/*.o
